cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Vigía in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Vigía: on-device driver fatigue detection in the browser"
abstract: "Open-source prototype that estimates driver fatigue (EAR, PERCLOS, yawns, head pose) with MediaPipe and OpenCV.js entirely on the user's device, with a Python toolkit for analysis."
authors:
